            "It sketches a setting by presenting a series of\nimages of nature.",
            "It makes an extended comparison of nature to\nhuman emotions.",
            "It names animal species found in a place, then\nnames plant species there."
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is B (Answer Key: Topic 9, Q6). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        },
        {
