          "passage": "A team of researchers discovered that Matabele\nants can identify an infected wound in a member\nof the colony and then treat the infection by\ncovering the wound with antimicrobial\nsecretions that the ants produce. The team\nfound that the mortality rate for Matabele ants\nwith infected injuries was reduced by 90% with\nthis treatment, and they are hopeful that this\ndiscovery could aid in the development of new\nantibiotics for human use.",
