          "passageTitle": "Overall Structure — Q37",
          "passage": "The Reckoning and Resilience(2022) exhibition\nat Duke University's Nasher Museum of Art in\nDurham, North Carolina, was curated to feature\nthe work of thirty North Carolina artists. The\nincluded artists represent a wide variety of\nartistic disciplines, from painters such as Juan\nLogan to the sculptor Stephen Hayes. In its\ninclusion of many borrowed works, the\nexhibition is atypical for the Nasher Museum,\nwhich tends to curate its exhibitions around the\npermanent collection of contemporary art that it\nowns.",
